abstract: >-
  Concept note and map of the bush, version 0.1. The text of our time is already
  bilingual: living human words and computed machine words are woven together, and
  both a person and a machine write and read it. The Bush Book is built on this
  consciously: each chapter shows the seam between the two languages, carries a
  passport for the machine reader, and records its sources and outflows as
  machine-readable links. Written with Claude (Anthropic).
